                                                      (if (= wd-why 2) 214 210))
                                                    (if (= wd-armed 2) 213 211))
                                          ;; WHAT KILLED THE LAST BOOT.
                                          ;; The #UD/#GP handlers write their
                                          ;; vector to offset 1024 of this page
                                          ;; and reset; DRAM survives a warm
                                          ;; reset, so the byte is still here.
                                          ;; D0 = the last run died on #UD,
                                          ;; which is where fuel exhaustion
                                          ;; arrives; D1 = it died on #GP.
